{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/TelemetryEvent"]]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"configClamped","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"setting","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"requested","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"effective","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"contractReference","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"setting","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"the configuration property’s name, e.g. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"decisionMemoTtl"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"name":"requested","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"the value the caller asked for, rendered.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"effective","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"the value actually in force, rendered."}]}]},{"name":"contractReference","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"the §-reference for the limit, e.g. "},{"code":"§17.1 rule 2","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Clamping rather than rejecting is the right call — rejecting would fail construction for a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"caller whose configuration was merely optimistic, and honoring would let one client become","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the herd §16 exists to prevent. Doing it ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"silently","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" is the part that is wrong: an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"operator who set a 60-second memo TTL believes their staleness bound is 60 seconds. It is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"five, and their revocation reasoning is off by a factor of twelve with nothing anywhere to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"say so.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Not emitted for a value already within its limit: an event that fires when nothing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"happened trains its reader to ignore it."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/TelemetryEvent\/configClamped(setting:requested:effective:contractReference:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"case","roleHeading":"Case","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK14TelemetryEventO13configClampedyACSS_S3StcACmF","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"configClamped"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"setting"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"requested"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"effective"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeId